# MASTER PROMPT: IMOVIES — FULL-STACK MERN MOVIE TICKET BOOKING SYSTEM

## 1. Project Overview

Build a complete, functional, professional full-stack web application named **iMovies — Movie Ticket Booking Made Simple**.

This is an individual college software engineering project. It must be a real working MERN stack application, not a static UI prototype or a frontend-only mockup.

The project must be organized, secure, responsive, easy to run locally, ready for GitHub, and suitable for a college mentor to review and evaluate.

Use the uploaded screenshots as the primary visual reference for the interface. Reproduce their dark navy cinema-themed design, red and pink accents, movie poster cards, compact navigation bars, and clean form layouts while improving responsiveness, readability, accessibility, and usability.

Do not copy unrelated elements from the screenshot website. Build an original implementation of the iMovies application.

